---
---

<section class="py-28" id="about">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">

    <!-- Section header -->
    <div class="mb-16">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
        <span class="block w-8 h-px bg-brass flex-shrink-0"></span>
        <span class="font-mono text-xs text-brass tracking-[0.2em] uppercase">Background</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-display text-5xl md:text-6xl font-light text-chalk">About Me</h2>
    </div>

    <!-- Bio + Skills -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_340px] gap-16 mb-20">

      <!-- Bio -->
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <p class="text-chalk-secondary text-base leading-relaxed">
          I spent most of my childhood and early college career obsessed with golf. I was fortunate enough
          to land a starting role on the Midwestern State golf team after I left my high school career behind.
          Midwestern State was the place where I would make a critical decision.
        </p>
        <p class="text-chalk-secondary text-base leading-relaxed">
          After dedicating all that time towards golf (which I still love), I began to get the feeling that it
          didn't provide any inherent value to the world. I realized that I could enjoy golf on my own time
          while pursuing something that would produce real value. That is when I decided to go all in for
          mechanical engineering, jumping head first into thermodynamics and physics.
        </p>
        <p class="text-chalk-secondary text-base leading-relaxed">
          Beyond academics, I found a real passion for lifting weights and the science of what makes muscles
          grow. That led me down a path of studying longevity research and gaining a better understanding of
          how our biology works. Besides that, I enjoy hiking, fishing, and coding.
        </p>

        <!-- Quote -->
        <blockquote class="mt-10 pl-5 border-l-2 border-brass">
          <p class="font-display text-xl font-light italic text-chalk leading-relaxed">
            "The happy man is the one who has a healthy body, a wealthy soul and a well-educated nature."
          </p>
          <footer class="mt-3 font-mono text-xs text-chalk-muted tracking-wider">— THALES</footer>
        </blockquote>
      </div>

      <!-- Skills -->
      <div>
        <div class="mb-5">
          <span class="font-mono text-xs text-chalk-muted tracking-[0.15em] uppercase">Technical Skills</span>
          <div class="mt-2 w-full h-px bg-ink-line"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          {[
            'CAD Design', 'SolidWorks', 'FEA / ANSYS',
            'MATLAB', 'Python', 'C / C++',
            'Thermal Analysis', 'System Identification',
            'Control Systems', 'Robotics', 'Data Acquisition',
            'Technical Writing',
          ].map((skill) => (
            <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-mono text-chalk-secondary border border-ink-line rounded bg-ink-card hover:border-chalk-muted hover:text-chalk transition-colors duration-150">
              {skill}
            </span>
          ))}
        </div>

        <div class="mt-10">
          <div class="mb-5">
            <span class="font-mono text-xs text-chalk-muted tracking-[0.15em] uppercase">Interests</span>
            <div class="mt-2 w-full h-px bg-ink-line"></div>
          </div>
          <ul class="space-y-3">
            {[
              ['Mechanical Design', 'Creating systems that move and transfer energy'],
              ['Bodybuilding & Longevity', 'Physical performance and health science'],
              ['Software Development', 'Simulation, control, and automation tools'],
              ['Engineering Analysis', 'Thermal, structural, and dynamic modeling'],
              ['Outdoors', 'Golf, hiking, and fishing'],
            ].map(([title, desc]) => (
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="mt-[5px] block w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-brass flex-shrink-0"></span>
                <span>
                  <span class="text-sm text-chalk font-medium">{title}</span>
                  <span class="text-chalk-muted text-sm"> — {desc}</span>
                </span>
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Education -->
    <div>
      <div class="mb-10">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <span class="block w-8 h-px bg-brass flex-shrink-0"></span>
          <span class="font-mono text-xs text-brass tracking-[0.2em] uppercase">Education</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        <!-- UTA -->
        <div class="group p-6 border border-ink-line rounded bg-ink-card hover:border-ink-subtle transition-colors duration-200">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between gap-2 mb-2">
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-medium text-chalk">University of Texas at Arlington</h3>
              <p class="text-chalk-secondary text-sm mt-0.5">Bachelor of Science in Mechanical Engineering</p>
            </div>
            <span class="font-mono text-xs text-chalk-muted whitespace-nowrap border border-ink-line px-3 py-1.5 rounded self-start">
              Fall 2022 – Present
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mt-3">
            <span class="block w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-brass"></span>
            <span class="font-mono text-xs text-chalk-muted tracking-wider uppercase">In Progress</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- MSU -->
        <div class="group p-6 border border-ink-line rounded bg-ink-card hover:border-ink-subtle transition-colors duration-200">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between gap-2 mb-2">
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-medium text-chalk">Midwestern State University</h3>
              <p class="text-chalk-secondary text-sm mt-0.5">Bachelor of Science in Mechanical Engineering · GPA 4.0 · Division II Golf</p>
            </div>
            <span class="font-mono text-xs text-chalk-muted whitespace-nowrap border border-ink-line px-3 py-1.5 rounded self-start">
              Fall 2021 – Spring 2022
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mt-3">
            <span class="block w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-chalk-muted"></span>
            <span class="font-mono text-xs text-chalk-muted tracking-wider uppercase">Transferred</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
